                            {
                                "example_id": "49baa7a7-7755-4041-b87b-aad15bb887e5",
                                "sense_id": "ff4be58a-7df7-3025-982a-905fea7b2a0d",
                                "text": "— Я всё в буфе́те и наблюда́ю, — прошепта́л он с ви́дом винова́того шко́льника, впро́чем наро́чно подде́ланным, что́бы ещё бо́лее её раздразни́ть.",
                                "translation": "\"I've been in the buffet all this time, watching,\" he whispered, with the air of a guilty schoolboy, assumed on purpose, however, to tease her even more.",
                                "english": "\"I've been in the buffet all this time, watching,\" he whispered, with the air of a guilty schoolboy, assumed on purpose, however, to tease her even more."
